                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.30340/2610.30340v1/architecture-v38.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Foundation4Darchitecture.Foundation4Dunifies driving perception and reconstruction in a feed-forward model with a shared representation of multi-camera video. A common image encoder and factorized spatiotemporal attention efficiently combine observations across views and time. Task-specific decoders recover camera-to-rig calibration, ego motion, and metric depth; predict 3D objects, velocities, and high-resolution semantic occupancy; and reconstruct scene appearance with 3D Gaussians.",
                "position": 528
            },
