                "caption": "Figure 3:Foundation4Dsemantic occupancy BEV features.PCA of the upsampled features reveals a separation between occupied and empty regions. All panels show the same sample; PCA colors encode feature variation, while prediction colors denote semantic classes.",
                "position": 724
            },
